# Simulation output (generated by mol_simulation.py/mol_display.py, written to
# output/<molecule>/). Position history and the generated viewer both embed
# one row/entry per atom per recorded tick and can get huge; everything else
# (topology, energy/bond history, plots) is small enough to keep.
output/**/*_positionHistory.csv
output/**/*_viewer.html
*.orig
